Build locally, then review and approve a signed archive on a device

Usage: korri plugins sideload [OPTIONS] [dir]

Arguments:
  [dir]  [default: .]

Options:
      --json                          Print unchanged RPC responses as JSON
      --self-contained                Include shared packages for installation without network access
      --upload <ID>                   Review or install this existing upload without building or sending it again
      --yes                           Confirm destructive actions; never grants plugin permissions
      --device <NAME_OR_KEY>          Device performing the operation, not a streaming route
      --platform <NIX_SYSTEM_OR_ANY>  Target platform, or any for a source-only plugin; peers do not report platforms yet
      --approval <REVIEWED_DIGEST>    
      --socket <PATH>                 Local korrid person socket
  -h, --help                          Print help
